-- Fills in the catalog from qualitycomputer.com.np (the site the catalog was first seeded from, used with the
-- owner's permission - see 0024): for each catalog item that is the same product as one on the site, the
-- real picture where the item still has a generic stock photo, and the specifications as the description
-- ("Key: value | Key: value", the shape 0019 uses) where the description is empty or only a short line.
-- Matched by name (checked by hand against the site's own pages, by model number), pages read from the
-- site's sitemap at one request every 1.2 s; nothing else was read. Prices are not taken: a price is always
-- the seller's own. The products linked to each catalog item are given the same picture and text.
-- Existing longer descriptions and real pictures are left as they are.
-- Additive only. Safe to run more than once.

